# Second half of the same mode=menus/844x390,touch/carried session (split into
# its own invocation per direction.md's "a second open #hash mid-script does
# not reset the run" driver lesson). The front-door tap count is already
# measured (2026-10-29-5.play: 4 taps raid->fight, 3 taps battleground->fight).
# This half measures the other number direction.md's "Not yet filed" list asks
# for: the tap count from a wipe back into the same pull. Skyward Deck's
# boss_slam killed a `wander` tank in 18s (direction.md hypothesis 6 vintage
# note, 2026-09-28) -- the fastest reliable wipe on record -- so that cell is
# reused here on purpose, to get the wipe cheaply rather than to re-test it.
open #b=skyward&s=10&h=1
targets
tap class:warrior:protection
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
play wander 40
shot after-wander
says
state
